@startuml
title E Visa Processing and Follow-up System State Diagram

state CreateAccount <<choice>>
state Login <<choice>>
state ApplyVisa <<choice>>
state ViewStatus <<choice>>
state CheckStatus <<choice>>
state CancelApplication <<choice>>
state ModifyDetails <<choice>>
state ViewDetails <<choice>>
state ViewPurpose <<choice>>
state GiveFeedback <<choice>>
state Logout <<choice>>

[*] --> CreateAccount

state Registered
Registered : entry / User created account
Registered : do / Login successful

state LoggedIn
LoggedIn : entry / User logged in
LoggedIn : do / Application submitted

state Applied
Applied : entry / User applied for visa
Applied : do / Payment made and application accepted

state ViewedStatus
ViewedStatus : entry / User viewed status
ViewedStatus : do / Status checked

state Cancelled
Cancelled : entry / User cancelled application
Cancelled : do / Application cancelled

state Modified
Modified : entry / User modified details
Modified : do / Details updated

state ViewedDetails
ViewedDetails : entry / User viewed details
ViewedDetails : do / Details viewed

state Purposed
Purposed : entry / User viewed purpose of application
Purposed : do / Visa approved or rejected

state FeedbackGiven
FeedbackGiven : entry / User gave feedback
FeedbackGiven : do / Feedback submitted

CreateAccount --> Registered
Registered --> Login

Login --> LoggedIn
LoggedIn --> ApplyVisa

ApplyVisa --> Applied
Applied --> ViewStatus

ViewStatus --> CheckStatus
CheckStatus --> Purposed

Purposed --> Applied

Cancelled --> [*]
Modified --> Logout
ViewedDetails --> Logout
FeedbackGiven --> Logout
Purposed --> Logout

@enduml
